From: sjcsf <346224915+llsf2020@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 03 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 14/14] FreeChat: emergency PIN for the app lock on iOS

In the app lock settings the user can set an emergency PIN of four
digits, different from the PIN, kept in the keychain on this device
only. Entered to unlock, it signs out and erases this device's data at
once, like a forgotten PIN but without a prompt, and does not count as
a wrong PIN. It goes when the app lock is turned off, and a new PIN
equal to it removes it.
